# Kraven's Cats (2/2): "{2}{G}: This creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn." Bot1 casts it on turn 1
# with Mox Emerald and Mox Ruby; the three other Rubies, its only untapped sources, make {R}{R}{R} and cannot pay {2}{G} (the
# refusal, for want of mana). On turn 3 Emerald#1, Ruby#1 and Ruby#2 pay it exactly (the pool is empty after) and it is a 4/4 that
# attacks (20 -> 16); a second activation in combat (Ruby#3, Ruby#4 and Emerald#2 would pay it) is refused, once each turn. On
# turn 5 it is a 2/2 again and can be activated again.

